      "id": "4106f4b3-8095-4014-9292-df66eeed8f4d",
      "text": "The proposed packaging is one justified pure Dart domain package, provisionally named `madar_domain`, for shared exact primitives; pure `madar_application` may be extended for new ports, with optional `madar_data` for storage. The plan excludes per-value/class packages, Flutter or vendor imports in the pure core, an app-owned copied backend, a new unused logger, a generic financial schema, and a new property-based-testing library; existing file/PDF/native/preferences contracts, logging, and the pinned SDK stack must remain compatible. | Involving: Madar project engineering team | These are proposed packaging and compatibility constraints, not verified implementation results.",
