      "id": "b2f27d67-bda8-4131-b31f-d774fa6e4aca",
      "text": "The candidate `packages/icu_collation` package (`madar_icu_collation` 0.1.0-dev.1) documents an ICU native bridge, Dart FFI binding, `CollationPort`/`CollationSession` adapter, public barrel, README, and example. The binding is documented to require ICU 78.2, Unicode 17.0, and CLDR 48.0; support only macOS ARM64; fail closed on unsupported platforms; preserve embedded NULs; enforce normalization; clean up native and parent/child resources safely; and reject process-global data replacement. | When: November 7, 2026 | These are the documented engineering rules and interfaces for the collation package candidate.",
