    {
      "id": "390aea1c-67dd-49cd-9381-b994f8bd094d",
      "text": "Dakhl_Restaurant recorded passing isolated macOS, iOS Simulator, and Android Emulator scenarios using the unchanged reviewed revision. Each scenario demonstrated first-page PDF-to-PNG output, application route rendering, and complete-envelope replacement; it did not verify all PDF pages, OS share/print dialogs, mobile ICU parity, or release readiness. | When: Sunday, November 08, 2026 | Involving: Dakhl_Restaurant | This is a consumer native checkpoint, not comprehensive native or release acceptance.",
