    {
      "id": "e9f4ae22-5d0c-4b61-9351-108264c7296c",
      "text": "The selected architecture keeps the reusable byte/page contract and engine implementation in Madar, while leaving viewing widgets, navigation, fonts, report composition, business data, consumer composition, and synthetic native acceptance to the consumer/Lead. Importing the native PDF vendor into the consumer was rejected because it violates the engine ownership check. | When: November 8, 2026 | Involving: Project Madar; the Lead | This preserves engine ownership boundaries without adding a third-party dependency.",
      "type": "world",
      "entities": [
        "Consumers",
        "Madar Engine",
        "Project Madar",
        "Lead"
      ],
