    {
      "id": "f3348e75-8e4f-492f-8555-cef1a259e8d4",
      "text": "`NativePdfHandoff` checks only the leading `%PDF-` signature, copies the supplied bytes, and hands them to system share/print facilities. A successful result proves handoff only—not recipient delivery or physical printing; a false share response is `share_unconfirmed`, while a false print response is treated as cancellation. | Involving: NativePdfHandoff | The caller retains responsibility for composition, fonts, layout, authorization, and stronger validation of untrusted documents.",
      "type": "world",
      "entities": [
        "NativePdfHandoff",
        "share_unconfirmed",
        "pdf",
        "system share/print facilities"
      ],
