    {
      "id": "e4140a37-4439-42bb-b9bf-26f4edb27a46",
      "text": "CAP-02 local source preview adds pure madar_domain 0.1.0-dev.1, madar_application 0.1.0-dev.3, and madar_data 0.1.0-dev.2; the native adapter remains 0.1.0-dev.1. Final-source tests and review pass, while consumer native/per-operation gates and the broader business release remain separately tracked and unresolved. Sources: packages/application/README.md, packages/domain/README.md, packages/data/README.md, docs/decisions/0010-local-account-workspace-snapshots.md, and PHASES.md. | When: As of November 08, 2026 | Involving: Project Madar | The bounded allocation is explicitly local-only and opaque; passing final-source tests and review does not establish the remaining consumer or release gates.",
