    {
      "id": "20e992d9-5334-4245-8226-fd90607038d8",
      "text": "The candidate implementation reuses pinned `printing 5.15.1`, requires no direct vendor import for consumers, and includes callback tests for argument bounds, ownership, failure/retry, cancellation, and output checks. These tests do not establish native PDF decoder support; optional platform raster support still requires verification by the actual native consumer. | When: As documented on November 8, 2026 | Involving: Project madar and consuming Lead | Separates implemented/tested adapter behavior from unverified native consumer support.",
